<title>USA: Ben Franklin Retail names CFO.</title>
<headline>Ben Franklin Retail names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CAROL STREAM, Ill. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ben Franklin Retail Stores Inc said on Monday it named Steven Zabel senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Zabel was vice president and chief financial officer of the Warehouse Club Inc.</p>
